{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261022/photo/bkn-20261022082925649-1022_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261022193106\"/><p>屯門發生交通意外。今日(22日)早上8時15分，兩輛巴士沿鳴琴路往良景邨方向行駛，至山景邨對開時意外相撞，據報包括兩車司機共有9人受輕傷，多輛救護車奉召到場將傷者送院治理。據悉，當時懷疑有巴士切線，意外導致兩車首尾相撞，確實意外成因有待警員調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T17:20:50.509752+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":131,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T00:29:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:10.832159+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:18:10.832159+00:00","content_hash":"b1d12c98132a2c2fc2e51fcaf40eac807eeb399ca4926a605d8bf313b384f487","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}